From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 09:09:31 +0000
Subject: serial: lantiq: allow building for the Intel MIPS platform

The Lantiq ASC UART is the console device of the Intel MIPS (xRX500)
family as well. Extend the SERIAL_LANTIQ dependency so it is
selectable on INTEL_MIPS.

From the 2018 intel-mips platform series ("serial: intel: Support
more platform") by Songjun Wu <songjun.wu@linux.intel.com>:

  https://lore.kernel.org/all/20180803030237.3366-1-songjun.wu@linux.intel.com/

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5
Signed-off-by: Grische <github@grische.xyz>

diff --git a/drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig b/drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig
index 2b9c8b39d68f..cf85a773fe70 100644
--- a/drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/tty/serial/Kconfig
@@ -1002,7 +1002,7 @@ config SERIAL_SIFIVE_CONSOLE
 
 config SERIAL_LANTIQ
 	tristate "Lantiq serial driver"
-	depends on (LANTIQ || X86) || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on (LANTIQ || X86 || INTEL_MIPS) || COMPILE_TEST
 	select SERIAL_CORE
 	help
 	  Support for UART on Lantiq and Intel SoCs.
